From 207d3aad3b70ac453a88aeacc20c5de29a2b0468 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LightMoss <lightmoss@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:55:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] power: supply: rk817_battery: resync a stale saved dsoc
 at probe

The gauge keeps the displayed state of charge (dsoc) in RK817 registers
that survive a reboot, and the driver starts from it when U-Boot has
already initialised the gauge. A dsoc saved by another OS on the same
card or eMMC (LightMoss boots the 4.4 or this 5.10 kernel, other R36S
systems leave their own value) can be far from the charge the coulomb
counter holds, and the battery then reads wrong until it is charged to
full. When the saved dsoc is more than 10% from the counted charge
(rsoc), start from the counted charge and save it.

Port of the second half of LightMoss's 4.4 patch board/r36s/linux/
patches/0005-power-rk817-battery-fuel-gauge-soc.patch, so both kernels
LightMoss can boot treat the saved value alike. Its first half (report
the fuel gauge SOC instead of the RG351P voltage line) is not needed:
this driver already reports (dsoc + 400) / 1000.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QTkmtGvwQ3V8JXzMT2JqWV
---
 drivers/power/supply/rk817_battery.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/rk817_battery.c b/drivers/power/supply/rk817_battery.c
index 86ed9dbb8..86a833f6f 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/rk817_battery.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/rk817_battery.c
@@ -1660,6 +1660,12 @@ static void rk817_bat_init_fg(struct rk817_battery_device *battery)
 	rk817_bat_rsoc_init(battery);
 	rk817_bat_init_coulomb_cap(battery, battery->nac);
 	DBG("rsoc%d, fcc = %d\n", battery->rsoc, battery->fcc);
+	/* A saved dsoc left by another OS survives U-Boot's init; start from the counted charge */
+	if (abs(battery->dsoc - battery->rsoc) > 10 * 1000) {
+		BAT_INFO("dsoc %d far from rsoc %d, resync\n", battery->dsoc, battery->rsoc);
+		battery->dsoc = battery->rsoc;
+		rk817_bat_save_dsoc(battery, battery->dsoc);
+	}
 	rk817_bat_init_dsoc_algorithm(battery);
 	battery->qmax = rk817_bat_get_qmax(battery);
 	battery->voltage_avg = rk817_bat_get_battery_voltage(battery);
